{"scene_id": "s00502", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00502.fountain", "heading": "INT. CATERING VAN - PARKED OUTSIDE A WEDDING VENUE - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "MIRKO DELL'ORTO", "names": ["MIRKO DELL'ORTO", "MIRKO"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 16}, {"id": 1, "name": "TAMSIN OKPARA", "names": ["TAMSIN OKPARA", "TAMSIN"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 5}, {"id": 2, "name": "BRIGITTE LACROIX-HAYES", "names": ["BRIGITTE LACROIX-HAYES", "BRIGITTE"], "gender": "f", "first": 7, "spoke": 11}, {"id": 3, "name": "LEONARD HAYES", "names": ["LEONARD HAYES", "LEONARD"], "gender": "m", "first": 7, "spoke": 10}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. CATERING VAN - PARKED OUTSIDE A WEDDING VENUE - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A white panel van with a three-tier cake lashed to the floor in a plexiglass box.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Crumb-dusted dashboard.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A wilted bouquet in a cup holder.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The engine ticks as it cools.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "MIRKO DELL'ORTO (40s, pastry chef, chef's whites unbuttoned) sits in the driver's seat gripping the wheel.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Beside him, his assistant TAMSIN OKPARA (20s, hair net, rubber gloves), holds a clipboard against her knees.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "In the back, wedged between trays of sugar flowers, sit the groom's mother, BRIGITTE LACROIX-HAYES (60s, mother-of-the-groom, fascinator tilted), and her husband LEONARD HAYES (60s, brown suit, hands clasped over his belly).", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody speaks.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a very nice cake.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["finally"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's leaning.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is a Tower of Pisa style.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a tower of Pisa, Mirko, in the sense that it's falling over.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Brigitte.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't \"Brigitte\" me.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Chef, I can fix it with a toothpick.", "name": "TAMSIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tamsin.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Three toothpicks and a wad of buttercream.", "name": "TAMSIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No toothpicks.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A skewer, then.", "name": "TAMSIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tamsin, no.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "She puts down the clipboard.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "She reaches over the seat, pulls a long bamboo skewer from a drawer, and gives it a look.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What's she doing?", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She's building a cake.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's already built.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's been built wrongly.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Leonard, do you ever listen to yourself?", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Every morning, dear.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Mirko turns around in his seat.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "He regards the cake the way a general regards a failing front.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Okay. We do this in five minutes. Tamsin, the skewer. Leonard, hold the top tier.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Me?", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You have steady hands.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I have a tremor.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then use the tremor.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mirko, I swear to God.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Madame, I have never lost a cake.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You are losing this one.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am not losing it. I am fixing it.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "He climbs into the back.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "The van rocks.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Leonard, uncertain, reaches out.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Tamsin kneels.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "The skewer slides in at an angle, slowly, and the top tier begins to straighten, one grudging degree at a time.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's moving.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's working.", "name": "TAMSIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mother of God.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["under her breath"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hold still.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am still.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're breathing.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a vital function.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The tier snaps into place.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "A little rain of sugar pearls patters to the floor.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "All four of them freeze, hands in the air, as though a bird has landed on them.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's straight.", "name": "TAMSIN", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's straight.", "name": "LEONARD", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you, Mirko.", "name": "BRIGITTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Madame.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "He nods.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "He climbs back out.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Brigitte straightens her fascinator.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Leonard wipes his palms on his trousers.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Tamsin sits back, flushed, still holding the skewer like a baton.", "para": 7, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "The back door of the van swings open.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "A bright, noisy hall beyond.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "A clipboard bangs twice on the door frame, and a bored voice somewhere says the cake team is up.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're ready.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "He looks at the cake.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "It leans, very slightly, again.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't breathe.", "name": "MIRKO", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["whispering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}